{
"#name"
:
{
"ajv"
:
null
,
"cn"
:
"基于 AJV 的超快流式 json-schema 校验工具，运行于 Deno 只读沙箱，支持 json / yml / toml"
,
"en"
:
"Blazing-fast streaming json-schema validator for json / yml / toml — built on AJV, runs inside a read-only Deno sandbox"
}
,
"#synopsis"
:
[
"x ajv [--all] [validate] -s schema[.json] [-d data.json | file1 [file2 ...]]"
,
"x ajv [--all] compile -s schema[.json] | [schema1 [schema2 ...]]"
,
"x ajv [--all] migrate -s schema[.json] -o migrated_schema.json"
,
"x ajv [--all] test -s schema[.json] -d data[.json] --[in]valid"
]
,
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"基于 Deno + AJV 的 json-schema 高效校验工具：编译一次、批量复用，支持 json / yml / toml，运行在只读沙箱内（仅 --allow-read；migrate 额外授予 --allow-write=<输出>，不授予 --allow-net / --allow-env / --allow-run 等任何额外权限）。支持数据校验、预编译 schema、迁移到 draft-2020-12、对 schema/数据做期望断言；validate / compile 还能从 stdin 流式读取文件路径，格式按后缀 (.json / .yml / .yaml / .toml) 自动识别。"
,
"en"
:
"Fast json-schema validator powered by Deno + AJV — compile the validator once, reuse it across every file. Supports json / yml / toml data. Runs inside a sandbox (only --allow-read / --allow-write=<output>; no --allow-net / --allow-env / --allow-run) — validate data, pre-compile schemas, migrate drafts to 2020-12, run assertion-style tests; validate/compile stream their file lists from stdin, file format auto-detected by extension (.json / .yml / .yaml / .toml)."
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"cn"
:
"流式处理：validate / compile 是按文件粒度增量推进的——读到一条路径就立刻校验/编译并输出一行 TSV，不会等到所有路径都到齐；stdin 上的路径列表也是按行喂入，无需先攒齐。配合 find / xargs 处理大批量文件很自然。"
,
"en"
:
"Streaming: validate / compile work file-by-file — each file is read, parsed and validated as soon as its path arrives, and the TSV result line is flushed immediately. stdin path lists are consumed line-by-line too, with no need to buffer them up front. Pairs naturally with find / xargs for bulk processing."
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"validate / compile 无位置参数时，会从 stdin 流式读取文件路径（一行一条）。"
,
"en"
:
"When no positional files are given, validate / compile stream file paths from stdin (one per line)."
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"解析错误信息自带行号/列号（JSON 的 line/column、YAML/TOML 的 line/column），调试时直接定位。"
,
"en"
:
"Parser errors include line/column (JSON: position + line/column; YAML/TOML: line/column), so debugging jumps straight to the offending location."
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"运行在 Deno 沙箱里：validate / compile / test 仅授予 --allow-read；migrate 额外授予 --allow-write=<输出文件>。从不授予 --allow-net / --allow-env / --allow-run 等任何额外权限。"
,
"en"
:
"Runs inside the Deno sandbox: validate / compile / test get only --allow-read; migrate gets --allow-read + --allow-write=<output>. No --allow-net / --allow-env / --allow-run or other extra permissions are ever granted."
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"默认只输出失败行（valid / compiled / pass / migrated 静默）；加 --all 才会把成功行也打出来。适合 CI / 大批量校验——只看哪里炸了。"
,
"en"
:
"By default only failure rows are printed (valid / compiled / pass / migrated stay silent). Pass --all to also surface success rows. Ideal for CI / bulk runs where you only care about what broke."
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"每次运行结束会在 stderr 输出一个 YAML 风格的 summary，包含 total / 按 result 计数（syntax-error、schema-error、invalid 等）/ 按 format 计数（json / yaml / toml）。"
,
"en"
:
"At the end of each run a YAML-style summary lands on stderr with total / per-result (syntax-error, schema-error, invalid, …) / per-format (json / yaml / toml) counts."
}
]
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x ajv -s schema.json -d data.json"
,
"cn"
:
"校验 data.json 是否符合 schema.json"
,
"en"
:
"Validate data.json against schema.json"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ajv -s schema.json f1.json f2.json f3.json"
,
"cn"
:
"批量校验多个数据文件"
,
"en"
:
"Validate a batch of data files in one pass"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ajv -s schema.json < paths.txt"
,
"cn"
:
"从 stdin 读取文件列表（每行一个路径）"
,
"en"
:
"Read the file list from stdin (one path per line)"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"find data/ -name '*.json' | x ajv -s schema.json"
,
"cn"
:
"把 find 的输出直接接到 stdin 上做校验"
,
"en"
:
"Pipe find output to stdin for bulk validation"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ajv compile -s schema.json"
,
"cn"
:
"预编译 schema.json（语法/关键字检查）"
,
"en"
:
"Pre-compile schema.json (syntax / keyword check)"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ajv compile schema1.json schema2.json"
,
"cn"
:
"批量预编译多个 schema"
,
"en"
:
"Pre-compile multiple schemas in one pass"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ajv compile < schemas.txt"
,
"cn"
:
"从 stdin 读取 schema 文件列表"
,
"en"
:
"Read the schema file list from stdin"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ajv migrate -s old.json -o new.json"
,
"cn"
:
"将 schema 迁移到 draft-2020-12"
,
"en"
:
"Migrate a schema to draft-2020-12"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ajv migrate -s draft-04.json -o new.json"
,
"cn"
:
"将 draft-04 schema 升级到 draft-2020-12（同时把 id 重命名为 $id）"
,
"en"
:
"Upgrade a draft-04 schema to draft-2020-12 (also renames id -> $id)"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ajv test -s schema.json -d data.json --valid"
,
"cn"
:
"断言 data.json 应当通过 schema.json 的校验"
,
"en"
:
"Assert data.json validates against schema.json"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ajv test -s schema.json -d data.json --invalid"
,
"cn"
:
"断言 data.json 应当被 schema.json 拒绝"
,
"en"
:
"Assert data.json is rejected by schema.json"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ajv --all -s schema.json data/*.json"
,
"cn"
:
"显示所有结果（包括成功的），适合排错或汇报"
,
"en"
:
"Show every row including successes — useful for debugging or reporting"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ajv -s schema.json data/*.json 2>&1 | tail -5"
,
"cn"
:
"默认只输出失败 + stderr 末尾的 YAML summary"
,
"en"
:
"Default behaviour — only failures on stdout, plus the YAML summary on stderr"
}
]
,
"#subcmd:Apply"
:
[
"validate"
,
"compile"
,
"migrate"
,
"test"
]
,
"validate"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"校验数据文件是否符合 schema（默认子命令）"
,
"en"
:
"Validate that data conforms to schema (default subcommand)"
}
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x ajv -s schema.json -d data.json"
,
"cn"
:
"默认子命令，可省略 \"validate\""
,
"en"
:
"Default subcommand, \"validate\" can be omitted"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ajv validate -s schema.json good.json bad.json"
,
"cn"
:
"一次校验多个文件，输出 TSV（每行 <file>\\t<valid|invalid>）"
,
"en"
:
"Validate multiple files in one pass; output is TSV (<file>\\t<valid|invalid>)"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"find data/ -name '*.json' | x ajv -s schema.json"
,
"cn"
:
"从 stdin 流式接收路径，配合 find/xargs 处理大量文件"
,
"en"
:
"Stream paths from stdin to validate a large set of files (works with find / xargs)"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ajv -s schema.json < files.txt"
,
"cn"
:
"从 stdin 读取路径列表（每行一个路径）"
,
"en"
:
"Read the path list from stdin (one path per line)"
}
]
,
"-s"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"schema 文件路径"
,
"en"
:
"Path to the JSON Schema file"
}
}
,
"-d"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"待校验的数据文件路径（与位置参数等效）"
,
"en"
:
"Path to a single data file (equivalent to a positional arg)"
}
}
,
"--all"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"默认输出失败行；加 --all 才会把成功行也打出来。"
,
"en"
:
"Show every row including successes — by default only failures are printed"
}
}
}
,
"compile"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"预编译 schema，检查语法与关键字"
,
"en"
:
"Pre-compile a schema to surface syntax / keyword errors"
}
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x ajv compile -s schema.json"
,
"cn"
:
"编译 schema.json"
,
"en"
:
"Compile schema.json"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ajv compile s1.json s2.json s3.json"
,
"cn"
:
"批量编译多个 schema"
,
"en"
:
"Pre-compile multiple schemas in one pass"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"find schemas/ -name '*.json' | x ajv compile"
,
"cn"
:
"把 find 的输出直接接到 stdin 上做批量编译"
,
"en"
:
"Pipe find output to stdin for bulk compilation"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ajv compile < schemas.txt"
,
"cn"
:
"从 stdin 读取 schema 文件列表"
,
"en"
:
"Read the schema file list from stdin"
}
]
,
"-s"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"schema 文件路径（与位置参数等效）"
,
"en"
:
"Path to a single schema file (equivalent to a positional arg)"
}
}
,
"--all"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"默认输出失败的 schema（成功的 compiled 静默）；加 --all 才会全部输出"
,
"en"
:
"Default: only schema compile failures; --all shows everything"
}
}
}
,
"migrate"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"将 schema 迁移到 draft-2020-12（同时重命名 id -> $id）"
,
"en"
:
"Migrate a schema to draft-2020-12 (also renames id -> $id)"
}
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x ajv migrate -s draft-04.json -o new.json"
,
"cn"
:
"将 draft-04 schema 升级到 draft-2020-12"
,
"en"
:
"Upgrade a draft-04 schema to draft-2020-12"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ajv migrate -s old.json -o new.json"
,
"cn"
:
"通用迁移: 把 $schema 设为 2020-12 并将 id 重命名为 $id"
,
"en"
:
"Generic migration: set $schema to 2020-12 and rename id to $id"
}
]
,
"-s"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"源 schema 文件路径"
,
"en"
:
"Path to the source schema file"
}
}
,
"-o"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"输出文件路径"
,
"en"
:
"Output file path"
}
}
,
"--all"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"默认只在迁移失败时输出；加 --all 才会显示成功"
,
"en"
:
"Suppress success — only print if migration fails"
}
}
}
,
"test"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"断言数据是否符合预期（--valid 或 --invalid）"
,
"en"
:
"Assert that data matches expectation (--valid or --invalid)"
}
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x ajv test -s schema.json -d data.json --valid"
,
"cn"
:
"断言数据应当通过校验"
,
"en"
:
"Assert data is valid"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ajv test -s schema.json -d data.json --invalid"
,
"cn"
:
"断言数据应当被拒绝"
,
"en"
:
"Assert data is rejected"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ajv test -s schema.json -d bad.json --valid && echo ok"
,
"cn"
:
"失败时退出码非零，可直接接入 CI"
,
"en"
:
"Exits non-zero on failure — usable directly as a CI gate"
}
]
,
"-s"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"schema 文件路径"
,
"en"
:
"Path to the JSON Schema file"
}
}
,
"-d"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"数据文件路径"
,
"en"
:
"Path to the data file"
}
}
,
"--valid"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"期望数据通过校验"
,
"en"
:
"Expect data to be valid"
}
}
,
"--invalid"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"期望数据被拒绝"
,
"en"
:
"Expect data to be invalid"
}
}
,
"--all"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"默认只在测试失败时输出；加 --all 才会显示 pass"
,
"en"
:
"Default: silent on pass; --all shows the pass row too"
}
}
}
}

